# PC card team-noconcord (TMODE-34, BENCH-160): arm bb (A/A, master again), on the four teams of plans/team-noconcord-set.txt, 24 fresh seeds from 7000, against master (the aa build). Template: ncprep writes work/team-noconcord-bb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
24
--seed-base
7000
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-noconcord-set.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-noconcord-@V@-bb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-noconcord-bb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
